  "comments": "<p>Joaquim José da Silva Xavier (1746 - 1792), also known as Tiradentes, was a leader of the colonial Brazil revolutionary movement to seek full independence from Portuguese rule.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Variant list:<br>1. 1998-2002: \"T\" wholly inside stripes; 13 lines; no mintmark;<br>2. 2003-2007: \"T\" partially inside stripes: 13 lines; no mintmark;<br>3. 2007-date: \"T\" partially inside stripes; 12 lines; no mintmark;<br>4. 2019: \"T\" partially inside stripes; 12 lines; \"A\" mintmark.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>13-12 lines variants:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5c98f4ad8600c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5c98f4ad8600c.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><br>2019 mint variants:<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6389f6a6c696a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6389f6a6c696a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67cce40a50431.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67cce40a50431.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67cce40eacb04.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67cce40eacb04.jpg\"></a></p><p>Official Sets - 2018 - Mintage 3000 Sets</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d87a4d855fff.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d87a4d855fff.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d87a4e1d1e0e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d87a4e1d1e0e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Official Sets - 2019 - Mintage 3000 Sets</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce2b6e785bb.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce2b6e785bb.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce2b71c0f43.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce2b71c0f43.jpg\"></a></p><p>Official card with complete set, including 1 real commemorative coin</p><p><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/641307b5e0e9d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/641307b5e0e9d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/64130788c0e8e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/64130788c0e8e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Official Sets - 2020 - Mintage 5 000 Sets</p><p><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/620679d53a69c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/620679d53a69c.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/620679f0268ec.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/620679f0268ec.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Official Sets - 2021 - Mintage 5 000 Sets</p>",
